<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" version="1.1" creator="mtl_bike tools/build.py" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1 http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1/gpx.xsd"><metadata><name>Day 3 (Tuesday Oct 6): Hudson to Schuylerville, NY</name><desc>77.7 mi (125.0 km), about +2,200 ft. Routed on OpenStreetMap along the official trails.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="42.25306" lon="-73.79604"><name>Hotel: The Wick, Hudson (Tribute Portfolio)</name><desc>Mile 80.3. 41 Cross St, Hudson, NY. (518) 249-6825. Near the Hudson Amtrak station, one block off Warren St.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="42.24871" lon="-73.78506"><name>Hotel: Hudson Whaler Hotel (formerly The Barlow)</name><desc>Mile 78.9, 0.4 mi off route. 542 Warren St, Hudson, NY. (518) 217-4334. The Barlow Hotel was sold and reopened as the Hudson Whaler: same building, new name and phone number.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="42.25278" lon="-73.79132"><name>Bike: Steiner's Sports</name><desc>Mile 80.3, 0.2 mi off route. 301 Warren St, Hudson, NY. (518) 828-5063. Bike sales and service. Listed Mon to Fri 10 to 6, Sat 10 to 5, Sun from 11.</desc><sym>Bike Trail</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="42.25407" lon="-73.79778"><name>Station: Hudson</name><desc>Mile 80.1, 0.0 mi off route.</desc><sym>Train</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="42.79009" lon="-73.67877"><name>Lunch: Don &amp; Paul's Coffee Shoppe</name><desc>Mile 50.5. 68 Broad St, Waterford, NY. . Diner on the route by the Waterford canal harbor. Listed Mon to Sat 7 AM to 7:30 PM, Sun 7 AM to 2 PM.</desc><sym>Restaurant</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.10274" lon="-73.57966"><name>Hotel: Dovegate Inn</name><desc>Mile 77.7. 184 Broad St, Schuylerville, NY. (518) 695-3699. Small inn with a few rooms on Broad St in Schuylerville village, with an on-site restaurant (Kitchen at the Dovegate Inn, 518-695-6095). Book early: limited rooms. Ask about bike storage.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="42.41800" lon="-73.67000"><name>Bike: Steiner's Sports (Valatie)</name><desc>Mile 16.0, 0.5 mi off route. 3455 Route 9, Valatie, NY. (518) 784-3663. In Valatie, just off the AHET around mile 15. Listed Mon to Wed 10 to 6, Thu and Fri 10 to 8, Sat 9 to 5, Sun 11 to 4.</desc><sym>Bike Trail</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="42.64125" lon="-73.74129"><name>Station: Albany-Rensselaer</name><desc>Mile 37.9, 0.1 mi off route.</desc><sym>Train</sym></wpt>
  <trk><name>Day 3 (Tuesday Oct 6): Hudson to Schuylerville, NY</name><desc>77.7 mi (125.0 km), about +2,200 ft. Routed on OpenStreetMap along the official trails.</desc><trkseg>
